      "value": "<p>A dusty tan moon with a very thin atmosphere and a resident population living in sealed structures under drifted regolith. Everything grown here is grown indoors and everything else arrives from the planet below. The moon takes its name from the discovery survey, which reported the system as having five planets and no moons at all.</p>",
